trix}\n$$\n\nwe can rewrite our expression as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\begin{vmatrix}-2x & &= & 2x\\end{vmatrix}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186054576 #edb/ref 1069 "e-6798" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186054576 #edb/ref 1071 "Simplify the expression $\\mid -18a \\mid$." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186054576 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "6be67098-9840-515b-b0db-e1a0ac9c0cf8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186054576 #edb/ref 1074 "Firstly, since\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}-a & = & a\\end{vmatrix}\n$$\n\nwe can write our expression as\n\n$$\n\\mid 18a \\mid\n$$\n\nThen, we distribute the absolute value over the multiplication, and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mid 18a \\mid &=  \\\\\n\\mid 18 \\cdot a \\mid &=  \\\\\n\\begin{vmatrix}18 & \\cdot & a\\end{vmatrix} &=  \\\\\n18 \\cdot\\begin{vmatrix}a & &= \\\\ 18 & a\\end{vmatrix}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186054577 #edb/ref 1069 "e-6799" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186054577 #edb/ref 1071 "Simplify the expression $\\left|-\\dfrac{9}{5c}\\right|$." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186054577 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "0a7c872a-a6f5-543e-835f-4c848f482282" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186054577 #edb/ref 1074 "Firstly, since\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}-a & = & a\\end{vmatrix}\n$$\n\nwe can write our expression as\n\n$$\n\\left|\\dfrac{9}{5c}\\right|\n$$\n\nThen, we distribute the absolute value over the division, and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mid \\frac{9}{5c} \\mid &=  \\\\\n\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}9 &}{\\mid 5c\\end{vmatrix}} &=  \\\\\n\\frac{9}{\\mid 5c\\begin{vmatrix}} &= \\\\ \\frac{9}{\\begin{vmatrix}5 & \\cdot & c\\end{vmatrix}}|= \\\\ \\frac{9}{5 \\mid c\\end{vmatrix}}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186054680 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186055223 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186054680 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186055494 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186054680 #edb/ref 1039 "Distributing the Absolute Value Over Multiplication" 